{"id":"662491","name":"香菜肉丸豆腐汤","author":"开心肥羊","authorId":"389860","desc":"","cover":"images/662491/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"水豆腐","amount":"300g"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"200g"},{"name":"猪肉丸","amount":"5粒"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"水豆腐切小块备用。","img":"images/662491/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"香菜洗净，剪短一点备用。","img":"images/662491/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中倒入适量清水跟肉丸一起烧开。","img":"images/662491/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水开后加入盐。","img":"images/662491/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"然后加入豆腐，加少许胡椒粉。","img":"images/662491/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再把香菜入锅。","img":"images/662491/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"滴入少许生抽，再煮3分钟即可关火。","img":"images/662491/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}